ker-falsifiable.md","a-sixth-backend-rule-the-checker-did-not-know.md","a-statically-typed-target-asks-for-the-types-the-checker-already-has.md","a-test-that-cannot-fail-is-worse-than-no-test.md","a-type-you-can-declare-but-cannot-build.md","backends-can-agree-and-still-be-wrong.md","borrowing-the-hosts-null-borrowed-its-conflations.md","checked-only-forms-are-a-class-not-a-lambda-rule.md","codepoint-order-is-not-utf-16-order.md","each-target-constrains-the-design-differently.md","index.md","jqs-item-wise-access-is-the-effect-layer-wearing-brackets.md","juxtaposition-is-unsafe-at-any-undelimited-boundary.md","losing-jaqs-corpus-means-building-the-agreement-harness.md","merging-passes-turns-redundant-traversals-into-bugs.md","named-functions-kept-an-open-question-open.md","one-invariant-three-independent-construction-sites.md","removing-the-effect-layer-makes-map-primitive.md","reorder-found-a-route-around-the-layout-it-did-not-reconcile.md","soa-is-cheap-until-something-wants-a-whole-element.md","streaming-input-is-pull-verified-against-jq-itself.md","the-backend-language-has-rules-the-checker-does-not.md","the-lowering-needs-types-the-checker-already-computed.md","the-widths-a-backend-cannot-fake-become-the-types-contract.md","track-an-incomplete-backend-as-a-shrinking-list.md","unescapable-control-bytes-are-the-crack-in-the-reserialization-gate.md","vec-of-enum-falls-into-the-boxed-default-nobody-chose.md","winnow-replaced-the-tokenizer-not-the-grammar.md"],"offset":1,"totalEntries":35,"truncated":false}},"title":"research-log","time":{"start":1788292192025,"end":1788292192027}},"id":"prt_05e85542e0014ctLj0HFAw00hu","sessionID":"ses_fa17fa8b8ffeRDvLpqU7vbxt5Y","messageID":"msg_05e84182b001M5HuIPzMfwpSkD"}}
